Read AGENTS.md first, then obsidian/README.md (the Map of Content) and
obsidian/workflows/ai-agent-guide.md (the hard rules).

Rule zero: .claude/stack.json is the single source of truth for this project's
paths, packages and commands. Never take a path or an import from an example in
the documentation — resolve it from stack.json. If stack.json has
"adapted": false, the kit has not been fitted to this codebase yet; adapt it
(see .claude/skills/stack-adapt/SKILL.md) before writing project code.
